= Act one: The rock

#scene(title: "Arrival at the lighthouse", type: "Encounter")[
The keeper's log is open on the table.#footnote(text: "The log was kept from 1871 to 1903.") Nobody has written in it for a week.

#read-aloud[
Wind tears at the door. The lamp above you turns, but nobody tends it. Å, ä and ö on every line.
]

#box(title: "The keeper's rule")[
*Light:* the lamp must never go dark.

- *Success:* the beam turns on time.
- Failure: a ship is lost on the rocks.
]

